    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n“Interested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\n\nOpportunity not to be missed to acquire a beautiful country residence & potential business facilities with separate detached two storey apartment, commercial wood cabin facilities of various sized rooms, two hot tubs, sauna pod and a wooden cabin bar all in excellent condition and ready for use located near the popular seaside village of Bundoran in Co. Donegal.\nThis substantial property must be viewed to be fully appreciated with its top-class facilities & excellent condition throughout.\n\nThe main residence\nIt is presented in show house condition with stunning countryside views and comprises on the ground floor of a spacious double height entrance hallway, kitchen / dining / living room with extensive range of kitchen units, large windows and a sliding door out onto a large wrap around elevated decking to the rear of the property, spacious utility room, luxurious private sitting room with open fireplace, guest wc, handy storage room and a downstairs double bedroom with an ensuite bathroom. \nAs you rise the feature staircase onto the open landing you get a sense of the scale of the property looking back down on the entrance hallway below. Leading off the landing are three very spacious bedrooms & a well equipped house bathroom. The bedroom to the rear has great distance views over toward Bundoran town and on out to the ocean. Below the main residence accessed from the rear is a large basement with garage, two large storage rooms, shower room and the boiler room ideal for many different uses.\n\nTwo storey apartment to the rear\nTo the rear of the main residence, is a detached two storey apartment in excellent condition comprising of a large open plan / kitchen / dining / living room & rear hallway on the ground floor and two bedrooms & bathroom on the first floor.\n\nThe wooden commercial facilities to the rear of the site.\nThe possibilities are endless with these amazing facilities. \nThere are two wooden commercial buildings of various sized rooms suitable for treatment rooms, an outside top tub, free standing bath, sauna pod, wc, outdoor shower & a roofed seating area with fire pit all in great condition suitable of many different uses. The buildings have heating & electricity also.\n\nAlso, within this expansive property there is a wooden bar hut, a second hot tub within a wooden hut and an outside BBQ area with fireplace.\n\nYou can finally cut ties with the corporate grind and run your own business; with all the freedom this allows. You can raise your family or retire in a picturesque location & most of all, this is an opportunity to purchase a property that affords you a new lease of life. It's an ideal setting in a peaceful location that overflows with natural beauty close to the wild Atlantic way route & the rugged coastline of the northwest of Ireland.\nLocated only 4km from the popular seaside town of Bundoran with great amenities close by including shops, pubs, restaurants, indoor leisure centre, great surfing, equestrian centre, golf course & miles of stunning sandy beaches. Sligo city only 35km approx.\n\nFolio number DL74395F"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nMain residence - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.9m x 5.2m\nfeature centre staircase, tiled flooring, wall panelling, double height ceiling\n\nwc - 2.3m x 1.8m\nwc, whb, tiled flooring, fitted wall units\n\nStore room - 1.8m x 1.2m\nshelving\n\nSitting room - 4.7m x 4.7m\nfeature open fireplace, three windows, coving & centre piece\n\nDownstairs bedroom with ensuite - 5.5m x 3.8m\nSliding door to rear elevated decking areaEnsuite - wc, whb, large shower, wall & floor tiling\n\nKitchen / dining/ living room (PART 1) - 5.8m x 7.6m\nExtensive range of fitted kitchen units with electrical appliances, centre island with sink & granite worktop. solid fuel stove, large windows with sunny aspect\n\nKitchen / dining / living room (part 2) - 4.2m x 2.5m\ndouble doors to large timber deck wrap around balcony\n\nUtility Room - 2.7m x 2.9m\nfitted units with sink, plumbing for washing machine & dryer, door to rear decking, tiled flooring\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - 4.1m x 1.7m\nLooks down into the front entrance hallway\n\nHotpress - 1.7m x 1.2m\nshelved out\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.6m x 4m\nwooden flooring\n\nWalk in wardrobe - 1.7m x 1m\nshelved out\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.8m x 4.5m\nwooden flooring, beautiful distance views of Bundoran & the ocean\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.7m x 3.4m\nwooden flooring\n\nLarge house bathroom - 4m x 2.9m\nwc, whb, large bath, separate shower, wall & floor tiling\n\nTwo storey 2 bed apartment to the rear - \n\n\nGround floor - \n\n\nKitchen / dining/ living room - 6.5m x 5.4m\nDouble doors to the front, fitted kitchen units, hall with staircase, understairs storage & back door\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - 2m x 1.9m\nhotpress\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.5m x 3.2m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.4m x 3.4m\n\n\nBathroom - 3.3m x 1.9m\nwc, whb, shower\n\nBasement garage room - 7m x 4m\n\n\nBasement storage room 1 - 4m x 4.8m\n\n\nBasement storage room 2 - 5.3m x 3.5m\n\n\nBasement shower room - 2.8m x 1.7m\nwc, whb, shower\n\nBoiler room - 2.7m x 1.5m\n\n\nTwo wooden timber buildings to rear - \n\n\nFirst building on the right - \n\n\nOpen covered outside seating area - \n\n\nReception Room - 3.5m x 3.5m\nElectricity & heating\n\nRoom with Bath - 3.7m x 3m\nFree standing bath, tiled flooring, electricity & heating\n\nOut door hot tub - \n\n\nSauna pod - \n\n\noutdoor shower - \n\n\nRoofed seating area with fire pit - \n\n\nWooden swing chair - \n\n\nBuilding 2 - \n\n\nReception room with wc - 4.9m x 4.9m\nwc, whb, electricity & heating\n\nReception room 2 - 4m x 2.9m\nelectricity & heating\n\nReception Room 3 - 4m x 3.2m\nelectricity & heating\n\nExternal garden lighting - \n\n\nWooden bar hut with outside seating area - 5m x 2.6 approx.\n\n\nOutside fireplace with seating area - \n\n\nWooden hot tub hut - 3.2m x 2.5m\n\n\n"
